<Layout title="Dustin Baker | Founder and Editor of ShouldISpend" description="Learn about Dustin Baker's role at ShouldISpend and how the site's calculators and guides are maintained.">
<main class="author-page">
<p class="eyebrow">Founder and editor</p><h1>Dustin Baker</h1>
<p class="intro">Dustin Baker is the founder and independent operator of ShouldISpend. He is a longtime digital publisher, writer, and editor who maintains the site's educational spending-pressure calculators and guides.</p>
<section><h2>What he maintains</h2><p>Dustin writes and edits calculator pages, reviews assumptions and examples, tests calculator behavior, checks site structure and links, and maintains the methodology used to explain spending pressure.</p></section>
<section><h2>How pages are reviewed</h2><div class="grid"><article><h3>Calculator testing</h3><p>Calculators are checked with ordinary, boundary, invalid, and unusually large inputs so outputs remain finite and internally coherent.</p></article><article><h3>Source review</h3><p>Outside benchmarks and consumer rules are documented through the <a href="/sources-and-assumptions/">Sources &amp; Assumptions</a> system when they materially affect a page.</p></article><article><h3>Editorial review</h3><p>Pages are checked for intent, realistic examples, decision limits, and whether the copy accurately describes what the calculator models.</p></article><article><h3>Corrections</h3><p>Readers can report unclear wording, stale information, broken links, or calculator behavior through the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p></article></div></section>
<section><h2>Educational role</h2><p>ShouldISpend is a decision-support publication. It does not represent its founder as a substitute for a professional who can review a reader's full financial, legal, medical, tax, insurance, or contractual situation.</p><p>Read the <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a> and <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a> for more about how the site works.</p></section>
</main></Layout>
<style>.author-page{width:92%;max-width:940px;margin:0 auto;padding:72px 0 48px}.eyebrow{color:var(--primary);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase}.author-page h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,5rem);line-height:1;margin:.5rem 0 1.2rem}.intro{font-size:1.18rem;color:var(--text);max-width:800px}.author-page section{margin-top:52px}.author-page p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px}.grid article{padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;background:var(--card)}.grid h3{margin-top:0}.author-page a{color:var(--primary);font-weight:800}@media(max-width:720px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
